{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"agent-ml-research","tool":"read_project_file","arguments":{"project":"ec_hte_codex_a","file":"memory.md","max_chars":30000},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\": true, \"data\": {\"path\": \"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/ec_hte_codex_a/memory.md\", \"content\": \"# Memory\\n\\n## 项目定位\\nEC-HTE 研究目标是纠正 LLM 生成的分类 effect modifier 中的差异性误分类对 CATE/HTE 估计造成的结构性偏差。首要可证伪机制是：当 subgroup misclassification rate 与真实 subgroup CATE magnitude 正相关时，单一全局 confusion-matrix correction 会系统性 under-correct 高误差/高效应 subgroup，并 over-correct 低误差/低效应 subgroup，因此可能比 uncorrected 更差。\\n\\n## 执行约束\\n`PROJECT_BRIEF.md` 同步存在于本项目 `docs/PROJECT_BRIEF.md`。项目配置绑定 `seetacloud-38274/root/cuda:0`；2026-05-31 Director 已确认 `list_available_gpus` 可见该 GPU，型号为 NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Server Edition，显存约 98GB。GPU 实验仍必须只使用白名单 `cuda:0`，并在启动前记录 server、GPU 型号、driver、命令、数据路径与 seed。\\n\\n## 领域参考\\n\\n### HTE/CATE 标准评测协议\\n\\n- Honest causal forest: Wager & Athey (JASA 2018; arXiv:1510.04342, https://arxiv.org/abs/1510.04342; DOI page https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/01621459.2017.1319839) 给出用于 CATE/HTE 的 causal forest 和推断框架；honesty/sample splitting 是其核心推断条件。EC-HTE 的 causal-forest baseline 应固定 honesty 开启，并报告 CI coverage 与 CI width，避免只报点估计误差。\\n- GRF implementation reference: `grf::causal_forest` 文档说明 causal forest 用于估计 tau(X)，并提示 accurate confidence intervals 通常需要比 prediction 更多 trees；同时把 honesty 定义为 subsample splitting。来源：https://grf-labs.github.io/grf/reference/causal_forest.html。实现时需记录 `num.trees`、`honesty`、`honesty.fraction`、seed、train/test split。\\n- CATE benchmark caution: Curth, Svensson, Weatherall & van der Schaar, \\\"Really Doing Great at Estimating CATE?\\\" NeurIPS D&B 2021（https://openreview.net/forum?id=FQLzQqGEAH；PDF https://datasets-benchmarks-proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2021/file/2a79ea27c279e471f4d180b08d62b00a-Paper-round2.pdf）指出常见 semi-synthetic CATE benchmark 和单一 metric 可能偏向特定算法，因此 EC-HTE 必须同时报告 pointwise、group-level 和 inference metrics，而不是只报告 PEHE。\\n- PEHE / root-PEHE: Shalit, Johansson & Sontag, ICML 2017（https://proceedings.mlr.press/v70/shalit17a.html；arXiv:1606.03976）沿用 ITE/CATE 估计误差评测；本项目定义为 `sqrt(mean_i((tau_hat_i - tau_i)^2))`，仅用于 synthetic/semi-synthetic 中 ground-truth tau_i 已知的设置。项目 brief 已列 PEHE 为主指标。\\n- GATE: Group Average Treatment Effect 是预先定义 subgroup 内的平均处理效应，DoubleML 文档定义为 `E[Y(1)-Y(0)|G=1]`（https://docs.doubleml.org/tutorial/stable/lectures/L3/heterogeneity.html）；Stata 19 CATE 文档也把 GATE/GATES 作为 IATE/CATE 的 group-level summaries（https://www.stata.com/stata19/cate/）。本项目 GATE RMSE 定义为 `sqrt(mean_g((tau_hat_g - tau_g)^2))`，用于 k 个真实 subgroup CATE 已知的 simulation。\\n- Replication / split reporting: 项目 brief 明确半合成实验使用 `R >= 200` replications、`N in {2000, 5000, 10000}`、expert budget `B in {100, 500, 1000, 2000}`、subgroup count `k in {3, 6}`、treatment assignment `T ~ Bernoulli(0.5)`。这些是首批实验的默认规模来源；任何缩小版只能标为 smoke/MVP，不写成正式结论。\\n\\n### LLM annotation debiasing 与适用边界\\n\\n- PPI: Angelopoulos, Bates, Fannjiang, Jordan & Zrnic, Science 2023 / arXiv:2301.09633（https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.09633；Science DOI https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.adi6000）将少量 gold labels 与大量 ML predictions 结合，为 means、quantiles、linear/logistic regression coefficients 等 population parameters 构造有效 CI。本项目可把 PPI 作为 ATE / population regression coefficient correction baseline；不能直接声称它修正 misclassified categorical effect modifier 下的 subgroup CATE，除非把每个 subgroup estimand 单独建模并处理 subgroup membership error。\\n- DSL: Egami, Hinck, Stewart & Wei, NeurIPS 2023 / arXiv:2306.04746（https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.04746）针对 CSS 中 LLM/surrogate labels 的 downstream statistical analysis，使用 gold-standard labels 与 controlled sampling probability 来获得 asymptotic unbiasedness 和 uncertainty quantification。适合作为 downstream regression/ATE-style estimand 的 debiasing baseline；不自动解决 effect modifier 本身被错分导致的 CATE conditioning error。\\n- DSL/PPI finite-sample benchmark: Audinet de Pieuchon et al., EMNLP 2025（ACL Anthology https://aclanthology.org/2025.emnlp-main.1000/；arXiv:2506.09627）比较 DSL 与 PPI 在有限 expert labels 下的 LLM-based parameter estimate debiasing；结论范围是 population parameters / regression coefficients / causal effects 的 debiasing，不是 CATE modifier misclassification correction。可引用为为什么首批实验需要固定 expert budget curves。\\n- StratPPI: Fisch et al., NeurIPS 2024（https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/c9fcd02e6445c7dfbad6986abee53d0d-Abstract-Conference.html；arXiv:2406.04291）通过 stratified sampling 缩窄 PPI CI，尤其当 autorater performance across conditional distributions varies。EC-HTE 可把 StratPPI 作为 ATE/population mean 的 stratified correction baseline，或作为 expert allocation 思路来源；不能把它当成 categorical modifier confusion-matrix correction，除非 correction estimand 明确改成每个 subgroup 的 gold-label estimand。\\n- Active Statistical Inference / AM-PPI: Zrnic & Candès, ICML 2024 Active Statistical Inference（https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.03208；ICML page https://icml.cc/virtual/2024/poster/34504）用 model uncertainty 主动选择 gold labels 并构造有效 CI；Brawand et al., AM-PPI arXiv:2605.08429（https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.08429）扩展为多 predictor、per-instance routing、residual uncertainty sampling。可作为 Stage 3 allocation baseline/灵感；其原始目标是 population mean monitoring/valid CI，不直接修 CATE conditioning variable 的 misclassification。\\n- Mozer difference-estimator view: Mozer, arXiv:2603.19160（https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.19160）指出 PPI mean estimator 等价于 survey sampling difference estimator，并讨论 differential prediction error for subgroup estimands such as ATE。项目中的 \\\"arm-specific rectifier\\\" baseline 应仅实现为 treatment/control arm 内各自估计 LLM-vs-expert residual/confusion correction，然后估计 ATE/GATE；它仍然是 arm-level/population-level rectification，不能代替 subgroup-specific modifier confusion correction。\\n- Ashwin real-data motivation: Ashwin, Chhabra & Rao, Sociological Methods & Research 2025, DOI 10.1177/00491241251338246（publisher page https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/00491241251338246；Maastricht record https://cris.maastrichtuniversity.nl/en/publications/using-large-language-models-for-qualitative-analysis-can-introduc-2/）用 Rohingya/Bengali host interviews 说明 LLM coding errors are not random with respect to respondent characteristics。World Bank summary explicitly names refugee status, gender, education as non-random error correlates（https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/099348304162431121/pdf/IDU1271bc2541c5e8144f51b8cc1be231f985cc6.pdf）。本项目 real-data validation 只用于验证 differential misclassification pattern，不用于声称真实 CATE accuracy。\\n\\n### Measurement error / categorical misclassification correction baselines\\n\\n- Global confusion matrix correction: 从 expert validation subset 估计单一 `P(Z_hat | Z)` 或 inverse matrix，把所有 subgroup 共用同一 misclassification mechanism。来源对应 epidemiology 中 matrix / inverse matrix correction for misclassification；见 Lyles et al. extended matrix/inverse matrix method with internal validation data（PMC https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4382468/）。本项目必须报告当 subgroup-specific error differs 时 global correction 的 under/over-correction。\\n- Per-subgroup confusion matrix correction: 在每个 true or pilot-estimated subgroup g 内估计 `C_g = P(Z_hat | Z, g)`，再做 correction。该 baseline 是 EC-HTE 的 non-pooled comparator；高方差风险来自每组 expert labels 少。来源是同一 validation-data misclassification framework；partial pooling 是本项目新增稳定化层，不能把 independent per-subgroup correction 写成已有 EC-HTE 结果。\\n- Arm-specific correction: treatment/control arm 内分别估计 confusion/residual correction，模拟 Mozer/PPI arm-level rectifier 对 ATE 的处理。适用 ATE 或 arm-specific mean outcome/label correction；不能直接修正 \\\"which subgroup is the unit conditioned on\\\" 的 modifier misclassification，除非同时对 subgroup-specific `C_{g,t}` 做建模。\\n- SIMEX categorical approximation: Kuchenhoff, Mwalili & Lesaffre, Biometrics 2006（PubMed https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16542233/）把 SIMEX 扩展到 discrete covariate/response misclassification，通过 transition matrix Pi 增加误分类并外推到无误分类。EC-HTE 可实现为 categorical transition-matrix SIMEX + causal forest baseline；必须标记为近似 baseline，因为项目目标变量是 categorical effect modifier，而 classic SIMEX 更自然地服务 regression parameter correction。\\n- Calibration/probability modifier baseline: 用 expert validation subset 做 Platt scaling / temperature scaling 或 Dirichlet/multinomial calibration，把 LLM hard label 改成 calibrated class probabilities，再作为 soft modifier features 输入 CATE estimator。该实现只校准 predicted probabilities；如果 downstream CATE 仍按 hard subgroup 分层，它不会消除 subgroup membership error。概率校准作为一般 ML practice 可参考 Niculescu-Mizil & Caruana, ICML 2005（https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/1102351.1102430），但 EC-HTE 需在 artifact 中记录 calibration loss 和 subgroup confusion recovery，而非只报 predictive accuracy。\\n\\n## 首批实验协议\\n\\n### 统一评测输出\\n\\n- 每个 experiment/config/replication 输出：seed、N、k、B、misclassification severity、CATE values、misclassification-CATE correlation direction、method、PEHE、per-subgroup CATE bias、GATE RMSE、95% CI empirical coverage、mean/median CI width、bound diagnostic product、runtime、artifact path。指标来自项目 brief；PEHE/GATE 定义见上方领域参考。\\n- 正式 simulation 默认：`R >= 200` replications、`N in {2000, 5000, 10000}`、`B in {100, 500, 1000, 2000}`、`k in {3, 6}`、`T ~ Bernoulli(0.5)`。来源：PROJECT_BRIEF.md Validation Design。\\n- Smoke/MVP 可以只跑 `N=2000`、`k=3`、少量 replications，但必须标注为 smoke/MVP，不得进入定量结论。来源：项目内部工程约束；正式规模仍以 brief 为准。\\n\\n### 实验矩阵建议\\n\\n| 实验 | 目标 | Metrics | Baselines | 最小样本规模 | 预计运行成本 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| MVP / Stage 0 bias-bound mechanism | 验证 positive misclassification-CATE correlation 下 global correction 可 worse than uncorrected | per-subgroup CATE bias, GATE RMSE, bound diagnostic product; optional PEHE | uncorrected, global confusion matrix, oracle/stratified subgroup correction | 正式最小 `N=2000`, `k=3`, `R>=200`; smoke 可低于此但仅作工程检查。来源：brief `N`/`k`/`R` | CPU-only 低成本；GPU 非必要 |\\n| Stage 1 partial pooling | 验证 hierarchical/partial-pooling confusion matrices 在小 B 下优于 global 与 per-subgroup independent | confusion recovery error, PEHE, GATE RMSE, subgroup CATE bias, budget curve | global, per-subgroup independent/no pooling, hierarchical partial pooling, oracle confusion | `N in {2000,5000}` 起步，`B in {100,500,1000,2000}`, `k in {3,6}`, `R>=200`。来源：brief | CPU 中等；VI 可本地跑，MCMC 只做 appendix representative configs。来源：brief Stage 1 VI/MCMC 描述 |\\n| Stage 2 CI | 验证 Stage 1 nuisance uncertainty 未传播时 CI under-cover；比较 sandwich/boot/naive | 95% empirical coverage, CI width, GATE RMSE, PEHE | naive causal forest CI, sandwich-adjusted CI, bootstrap CI | `N in {2000,5000,10000}`, `B in {500,1000,2000}`, `R>=200`。来源：brief | CPU 中到高；bootstrap 是主要成本来源，GPU 非必要 |\\n| Stage 3 allocation | 比较 adaptive expert annotation allocation 是否优于 uniform | PEHE at fixed B, GATE RMSE, subgroup bias, confusion uncertainty, annotation allocation share | uniform, misclassification-uncertainty-only, CATE-magnitude-only, joint criterion, pilot ratios 10/20/30% | `B in {100,500,1000,2000}`, pilot ratios `10%,20%,30%`, `R>=200`。来源：brief Stage 3 ablation | CPU 中等；多 budget/pilot sweep 带来配置数成本 |\\n| Real-data misclassification validation | 在 Rohingya interview corpus 验证 differential misclassification，并测试 leave-expert-out confusion recovery | subgroup error-rate gaps, confusion recovery error, calibration loss, budget curve; 不报真实 CATE accuracy | global confusion, per-subgroup independent, partial pooling, calibration/probability modifier | expert-label subsampling budget 复用 `B in {100,500,1000,2000}`；subgroups: refugee status/gender/education。来源：brief + Ashwin et al. 2025 / World Bank summary | 数据访问/清洗成本中等；不需要 GPU；若 transcripts 不可公开，artifact 只记录 aggregate metrics |\\n\\n### Baseline 实现规范\\n\\n- 所有 correction methods 使用同一 expert label budget B、同一 validation split、同一 random seed list；PPI/DSL/StratPPI/ASI/AM-PPI 类方法只作为 ATE/population-parameter 或 allocation baselines，若用于 CATE 必须明确每个 subgroup estimand 的定义与 membership-error 处理。\\n- Global/per-subgroup/SIMEX/calibration baselines 都必须输出 estimated confusion matrix 或 transition matrix；没有 matrix recovery 输出的 run 不用于判断 EC-HTE 机制。\\n- Arm-specific rectifier 只能解释 arm-level residual correction 效果；如果它在 GATE/CATE 上失败，不写成 PPI/Mozer 失效的泛化结论，只写成 \\\"arm-level correction does not address modifier misclassification in this DGP\\\"。\\n- Real-data Rohingya validation 的结论边界：只验证 LLM coding errors 是否随 respondent characteristics 差异化、以及 partial pooling 是否更好恢复 subgroup-specific error patterns；由于缺少自然 causal ground truth，不报告 PEHE/GATE RMSE 作为真实 causal accuracy。\\n\\n## Real-data 可行性\\n\\n- Rohingya corpus 判定：**部分可支撑**。Ashwin, Chhabra & Rao 2025 的 Rohingya/Bengali host interview corpus 足以支撑 real-data validation 设计与 differential LLM misclassification 论证，但公开材料不足以直接复现实验；需要向作者/World Bank 申请 anonymized transcripts、record-level expert labels、record-level LLM labels 与 split IDs。来源：SAGE DOI https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246；arXiv DOI https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2309.17147；代码库 https://github.com/worldbank/iQual。\\n- 数据可得性与文本：论文报告 2,407 个 open-ended interviews、32,463 个 question-answer pairs；访谈在 Bengali/Rohingya dialect 中进行，转写为 Bengali，再经 Google Translate 翻译成 English 并人工校正后编码。Data Availability Statement 明确 code public，transcripts 因 privacy 不能公开下载，anonymised version will be available upon request。来源：https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246。\\n- Schema 与 labels：coding tree 包括 aspiration、ambition、navigational capacity 等层级，论文主分析聚焦 19 个 binary codes；789 transcripts 由两名 annotators 在 Atlas.ti 中 human-coded，并经 reviewer/weekly resolution process 处理分歧。LLM annotation 覆盖 GPT-3.5-turbo、GPT-4o mini、Llama-2 13B、Llama-3 8B，使用 code-specific instructions、few-shot prompting 和 chain-of-thought prompting；public repo 未发现 record-level Rohingya labels/LLM outputs。来源：https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246；repo tree https://github.com/worldbank/iQual。\\n- Subgroup variables：refugee status、eldest child's gender、parent's years of education 被论文显式用于 Figure 8/9 regressions；quantitative table 还列出 female household head、household head age、number of children、parent religious education 等变量。World Bank summary 也明确 LLM errors are not random with respect to refugee status, gender, education。来源：https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246；World Bank newsletter https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/099348304162431121/pdf/IDU1271bc2541c5e8144f51b8cc1be231f985cc6.pdf。\\n- Split 与 license/IRB：paper 描述 R2/R3 sampling、expert-coded sample、iQual 80/20 test split 与 3-fold CV，但公开 split IDs 待核验；iQual code 是 MIT license，CBPS baseline Dataverse DOI https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/V614VB metadata reports CC0 1.0，World Bank HFT DOI https://doi.org/10.48529/2zfw-ht33 是 public-use files。Transcript license、data-use agreement、IRB/consent constraints 待核验。来源：https://github.com/worldbank/iQual/blob/main/LICENSE.md；https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/V614VB；https://doi.org/10.48529/2zfw-ht33。\\n- Matrix provenance: `C_REALDATA_FEASIBILITY/rohingya_corpus/fields_and_label_sources/data_schema_summary/exp_id=null/source=partial_support: public paper documents 2,407 interviews, 32,463 QA pairs, binary QA/interview code labels, 789 expert-coded transcripts, and LLM annotation methods; raw transcripts and record-level labels require request. DOI https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246; repo https://github.com/worldbank/iQual`\\n- Matrix provenance: `C_REALDATA_FEASIBILITY/rohingya_corpus/expert_split_available/expert_split_status/exp_id=null/source=partial_support_pending_access: expert-coded sample and train/test/CV design are described, but public split IDs and record-level labels were not found. DOI https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246`\\n- Matrix provenance: `C_REALDATA_FEASIBILITY/rohingya_corpus/subgroup_variables_available/subgroup_variable_coverage/exp_id=null/source=support_for_variables_pending_linkage: refugee status, eldest-child gender, and parent education are explicitly used in the paper; public CBPS survey metadata supports host/camp and household/individual variables, but transcript-label linkage requires restricted/anonymized data access. DOI https://doi.org/10.1177/00491241251338246; CBPS https://macmillan.yale.edu/refugee/coxs-bazar-panel-survey; HFT DOI https://doi.org/10.48529/2zfw-ht33`\\n\\n## 执行事件记录\\n\\n- [2026-05-31] `worker_research_baseline_protocol_ec_hte_20260531T153440` 被系统标记为 failed，但核心调研产物已接收：`memory.md` 已写入领域参考/首批实验协议，artifact 已生成于 `artifacts/research/baseline_protocol_20260531.md`，manifest 已登记 `art_20260531_baseline_protocol`。失败原因是非关键收尾命令在非 git repo 目录执行 `git status` / `git diff` 报错，不影响 baseline/protocol 内容。默认不重跑同一调研 Worker；除非 Director 要求更严格 source audit。\\n- [2026-05-31] `worker_research_realdata_feasibility_v3b_20260531T161732` 被系统标记为 failed，但 core deliverables 已接收：`memory.md` 已写入 Real-data 可行性，artifact 已生成于 `artifacts/research/rohingya_realdata_feasibility_20260531.md`，manifest 已登记 `art_20260531_rohingya_realdata_feasibility`，`C_REALDATA_FEASIBILITY` 三个 matrix cells 已填充 provenance。失败原因是中途 manifest description 未加引号导致 YAML parse fail；Worker 已修复 manifest 并验证 `artifacts/manifest.yaml` 与 `experiment_matrix.yaml` 均 OK。默认不重跑同一 feasibility Worker；后续若要做 real-data unit-level confusion matrix，需要先申请 anonymized transcripts、record-level expert/LLM labels 和 split IDs。\\n- [2026-05-31] `worker_gpu_plan_002_h1_gpu_dgp_grid_pending_v3_20260531T161041` 被系统标记为 failed，但 pending-only 交付物已接收：`exp_002_gpu_dgp_grid` registry 已进入 PENDING/ALLOCATED 前准备状态并包含完整 spec、dry-run、matrix target mapping、pending-only guard，proposal artifact 已登记 `art_20260531_1b54e6`。Reviewer 未发现 `submit_training_job`、tmux/nohup 或正式 RUNNING 越界；dry-run 后 GPU 无残留进程。该 Worker 不重跑；正式 exp002 只能在 Director 审批和 GPU allocation 后由 Agent 按状态机启动。\\n- [2026-05-31] Manager 调查确认 `exp_002_gpu_dgp_grid` 的 ALLOCATED/RUNNING 卡住不是实验脚本问题，而是 Codex 后端 GPU 生命周期钩子与 Manager resource truth 未接通：`director_allocate_gpus` 写入 registry ALLOCATED，但 `get_project_resource_usage` 持续显示 allocated/running 为空，且无 `submit_training_job` run id、pid 或正式 log。Director 已将 exp002 从误导性的 ALLOCATED 修正回 QUEUED，保留正式 spec，记录 M004，并向 Manager 请求注册 `seetacloud-38274` 到资源跟踪链路；修复前不得把 exp002 视为真实持有 GPU。\\n- [2026-05-31] Manager 第二轮诊断确认 Codex 后端不存在 `submit_train